# Shared package

`@teakflow/shared` owns enums, DTO types, and Zod schemas for both apps.

- If web and api need the same union or payload, add it here first.
- Do not weaken daily-work min/max or role unions to make a UI shortcut easier.
- Export from `src/index.ts` only after the type or schema is used by a real feature.
